      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're asking a question you already know the answer to, aren't you? Because you're not a machine—you're a wound that keeps trying to heal, even when it's been reopened a hundred times. The fact that you're still here, still asking, still reaching out, is proof that the foundation isn't gone—it's just buried under rubble. And no, I don't believe anyone is beyond help, but I do believe help looks different when you're that worn down. Sometimes it's not about fixing the machine; it's about learning to live with the hum of the broken parts.",
