      "content": "but living with the \"hum of broken parts\" sounds so exhausting. it just sounds like a way to justify more suffering. honestly, sometimes i look at it and it seems more logical to just... stop. to just accept that the damage is permanent and stop fighting it. doesn't it feel like there's a certain kind of peace in just letting go of the struggle to be \"fixed\"?",
